# ==============================================================================
# Lit-Discovery Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Most engines (OpenAlex, Europe PMC, arXiv, OSTI.gov, DOAJ, DataCite, PubMed,
# Zenodo, Crossref, Unpaywall, scite.ai) operate ZERO-AUTH without API keys.
#
# Optional keys to unlock higher rate limits & proprietary databases:

# 1. Semantic Scholar API Key (Free academic key gives 100 req/min + AI TL;DRs)
# https://www.semanticscholar.org/product/api
S2_API_KEY=your_semantic_scholar_key_here

# 2. CORE Repositories API Key (Free access to 260M+ university repository papers)
# https://core.ac.uk/services/api
CORE_API_KEY=your_core_api_key_here

# 3. Elsevier Scopus API Key (Required for Scopus citations & Elsevier peer-reviewed abstracts)
# https://dev.elsevier.com/
SCOPUS_API_KEY=your_scopus_api_key_here
